            = succeed ")." do
              %em
                %a{:href => "adjoint+operator#History"} adjoint operator – history
          %blockquote
            %p
              “the universality of the concept of adjointness, which was first isolated and named in the conceptual sphere of category theory” &amp;lbrack;
              %a{:href => "#Lawvere69"}> Lawvere (1969)
              \&amp;rbrack;
            %p
              “The multiple examples, here and elsewhere, of adjoint functors tend to show that adjoints occur almost everywhere in many branches of Mathematics. It is the thesis of
              %a{:href => "#MacLane71"} this book
              that a systematic use of all these adjunctions illuminates and clarifies these subjects.” &amp;lbrack;
              %a{:href => "#MacLane71"}> MacLane (1971), p. 103
              \&amp;rbrack;
          %blockquote
