                  %a{:href => "William+Lawvere#TakingCategoriesSeriously"} Taking categories seriously
          %h2#definition Definition
          %p There are various different but equivalent characterizations of adjoint functors, some of which are discussed below.
          %h3#InTermsOfHomIsomorphism In terms of Hom isomorphism
          %p
            We discuss here the definition of adjointness of functors
            %math.maruku-mathml{:display => "inline", :xmlns => "http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML"}
              %semantics
                %mrow
